          "value": "1.3.6.1.2.1.1.1.0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "snmp.error_status",
          "value": "0"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "RFC 3416 §4.2.1：GetRequest-PDU（tag 0xA0）、varbind 含 OID+value；community 默认 public",
